{"completed": true, "response": "这段亲近让他感到温暖和安心，所以他并不觉得自己需要逃开这段关系。可他想了很久、一直想让对方知道的心事，并不会因为现在过得幸福就消失。相处越真实、越珍贵，他就越想说出自己的心意；但越在乎这段关系，他也越担心说出口后会带来变化。他还是想让对方知道自己的心意，却还没准备好面对之后可能发生的事。此刻他没有做出新的决定，只是既不想放弃这份心事，也不愿轻易冒险改变两人现在的关系。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "540e858a-3e99-4aa6-a8c7-ed941330eb99", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003333402239Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.516, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:33:40.921419+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ab462febfebbf5c3648a4446f53d2ad1faef6c4525253b4f59fe1e102e12c893", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003333402239Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "s